│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ first_person_voice_persona                                                                │
│ patch_description        │ The old prompt was a list of things to avoid. The model followed it and still wrote       │
│                          │ neutral textbook prose: topic sentence, explanation, "This is why..." links, even         │
│                          │ paragraphs. Pangram flagged nearly all of it.                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The texts the real Pangram passed as human share a different trait. They come from a      │
│                          │ speaker with a stance: first person, opinionated, hedged ("I guess", "I mean"), with      │
│                          │ rhetorical questions and lopsided emphasis. The one passing output here was also first    │
│                          │ person and concrete.                                                                      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This version therefore builds a positive persona. The model answers as a regular person   │
│                          │ replying in a thread or writing to someone they know. It uses contractions, small hedges, │
│                          │ opinions, asides and occasional questions. It leads with its take, lets paragraphs be     │
│                          │ uneven, and stops when done. Experience is framed only vaguely and never as invented      │
│                          │ facts.                                                                                    │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ It also adds a short list of banned AI connective phrases and a strict brief-thinking     │
│                          │ instruction to avoid empty outputs. Temperature is raised a little to increase lexical    │
│                          │ unpredictability while keeping the task on track.                                         │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0491                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
