│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ persona_voice_by_kind                                                                     │
│ patch_description        │ The old prompt was one paragraph of style bans. It produced tidy, textbook-style          │
│                          │ explanations that the detector flagged at 90-95. The new prompt is organized in modules   │
│                          │ instead:                                                                                  │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. **Thinking limit.** A hard cap on reasoning comes first, so outputs never come back    │
│                          │ empty.                                                                                    │
│                          │ 2. **Persona.** A concrete first-person writer, modeled on the target examples. Those     │
│                          │ texts are opinionated and hedged ("I guess", "I mean"), ask themselves questions and      │
│                          │ sound lived-in.                                                                           │
│                          │ 3. **Voice moves.** A list of positive habits to use, rather than only things to avoid.   │
│                          │ 4. **Per-kind guidance.** Separate notes for answers, emails, notes, posts and rewrites,  │
│                          │ since each task type failed differently.                                                  │
│                          │ 5. **Fact-safety rule.** The voice may show opinion and uncertainty, but it must never    │
│                          │ invent anecdotes, numbers or people.                                                      │
│                          │ 6. **Quick final check.** A short list of AI tells to strip before output.                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Temperature is raised slightly so word choice is less predictable.                        │
