│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The texts the real detector passed share different traits:                                │
│                          │ - They are grounded in a concrete situation: what happened, what the writer saw or did, a │
│                          │ price, a time.                                                                            │
│                          │ - They carry one person's judgment and mildly uneven logic.                               │
│                          │ - They have no pedagogical scaffolding.                                                   │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This edit tells the model to:                                                             │
│                          │ - answer from a particular person's vantage point, with situational details framed        │
│                          │ vaguely, never invented facts;                                                            │
│                          │ - break the explainer template by leading with an aside or reaction and explaining only   │
│                          │ part of the mechanism;                                                                    │
│                          │ - treat notes as actual jotted notes;                                                     │
│                          │ - keep reasoning extremely short.                                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ It also adds a concrete banned-openers list drawn from the observed failures ("The short  │
│                          │ answer", "mainly", "This is why", "The term is not saying").                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Temperature rises to 1.05 for more lexical surprise, since a 27B model stays coherent     │
│                          │ there. TOP_P is set to 0.92 to trim the incoherent tail.                                  │
